    can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; roll a six-sided die and apply the
    result.

    1: Halve your Life Points. 2: Draw 1 card.

    3: Your opponent
    discards 1 card.

    4: Negate the effects of 1 face-up card on the field until
    the end of this turn.

    5: Destroy 1 card on the field. 6: Destroy this card.'
